        <FormAndLineReferenceDesc>Schedule O:</FormAndLineReferenceDesc>
        <ExplanationTxt>Form 990 EZ Part 1, Line 16 Other expenses consisted of programmatic supplies, production and fundraising costs. Form 990 EZ Part 3 The mission of Science Delivered! is to promote a love of science and learning. Science Delivered! aims to promote equal access to education with a focus on early elementary science. Science Delivered! strives to provide the highest quality programming to engage students and make life easier for teachers. We provide in-class hands-on science lessons integrated with literacy with a focus on grades K-3. We also create resources for teaching elementary science. Science Delivered! encourage students to confidently and critically engage in the world around them. Form 990 EZ Part 2, Line 24 Other Assets include accounts receivable. Form 990 EZ Part 2, Line 26 Total Liabilities include accounts and credit card payables as well as a loan payable.</ExplanationTxt>
